  "prefLabel": "Ph 401.03 Renewal Application Deficiencies",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-03-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 401.03 Renewal Application Deficiencies. Within 5 days of receipt at the board office, the board shall notify the applicant in writing if the renewal application is deficient. The applicant may then correct the deficiency or file with the board a written request for a hearing before the board.\n\nSource. #1639, eff 11-1-80; ss by #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10812, eff 4-18-15",
